  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Minister of Home Affairs Tito Karnavian has issued a directive to regional heads across Indonesia, emphasizing the importance of optimizing the Regional Leadership Coordination Forum (Forkopimda). This initiative is primarily aimed at enhancing disaster anticipation strategies at the local level. According to recent reports, the Ministry expects regional leaders to conduct thorough mapping of risks and ensure that coordination mechanisms between local government agencies and security forces are robust. By strengthening these forums, the Ministry intends to improve the country's collective response to emergencies and natural disasters. This policy shift is part of broader ongoing efforts by the Ministry of Home Affairs to improve governance, local infrastructure, and regional autonomy management, ensuring that local authorities are well-equipped to handle crisis situations effectively through structured cooperation and improved administrative planning.",
